#X text 875 80 And here's also how to implement it with [biquad~]. Unlike the other exampls \, you can't control the filter parameter with a signal input., f 42;
#X obj 785 484 cnv 15 180 50 empty empty empty 5 12 0 14 #fcc4c4 #404040 0;
#X text 791 500 H(z) =;
#X text 796 460 Transfer function:;
#X obj 699 384 v a;
#X obj 699 357 / 2;
#X obj 734 357 expr 1 - $f1;
#X obj 734 384 v b;
#X obj 479 331 fexpr~ a * $x + a * $x1[-1] + b * $y1[-1], f 27;
#X text 850 488 a - a * z^-1;
#X text 850 511 1 - b * z^-1;
#X text 837 494 ________________;
#X text 304 488 The filter formula then is: y[n] = a*x[n] + a*x[n-1] + b*y[-1], f 62;
#X text 338 509 where 'a' is radians per sample / 2 \, and b is "1 - a";
#X obj 81 371 s \$0-coeff;
